By solving the problem, I can see that the operating instructions provided in the question are ignored completely. Consequently, can you please supply the complete code for the console-based interactive menu-driven program described in the question?

This isn't a math problem, but rather a request for a programming assignment. However, I can infer what type of program you're looking for, a Dictionary.

Here's an example of how you can implement the program:

```java
import java.util.*;

public class Dictionary {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        Scanner scanner = new Scanner(System.in);
        Map<String, String> dictionary = new HashMap<>();

        while (true) {
            System.out.println(\nOptions:);
            System.out.println(1. Add a word);
            System.out.println(2. Search for a word);
            System.out.println(3. Exit);

            System.out.print(Enter an option: );
            int option = scanner.nextInt();

            switch (option) {
                case 1:
                    System.out.print(Enter a word: );
                    String word = scanner.next();
                    System.out.print(Enter a definition: );
                    String definition = scanner.next();
                    dictionary.put(word, definition);
                    break;
                case 2:
                    System.out.print(Enter a word to search for: );
                    word = scanner.next();
                    if (dictionary.containsKey(word)) {
                        System.out.println(Definition:  + dictionary.get(word));
                    } else {
                        System.out.println(Word not found.);
                    }
                    break;
                case 3:
                    System.out.println(Exiting...);
                    scanner.close();
                    return;
            }

            System.out.println(\n);
        }
    }
}
```

This program creates a simple dictionary where users can add words and their definitions, search for words, and exit the program.

